WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.900
So I'm asking people about The Hunger Games

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.270
and how they would survive.

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.390
 and I wanna know what your tactic is for surviving The Hunger Games.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.490
*grumpy meow*

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:10.780
Uhhh wow.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.410
I don't think I would survive.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:13.560
No, I would die first.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.700
I'd die within an instant.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.840
I would not survive.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:16.820
I'm not a survivor.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.780
I'd just ask them to kill me immediately.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.580
That's so dark though. You'd ask them to kill you?

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.870
I'd be like, "Just end my misery now."

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:25.810
Can I just stay in one place and wait for everyone else to die?

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:26.950
Do you know what weapon you would use?

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.400
A knife.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.380
Crossbow,

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.340
which is cooler than a regular bow.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.810
My weapon would be friendship.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:35.770
I would have a bag of donuts with me!

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.060
Smuggle that s@#$ in your purse.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:39.850
What weapon would you use to defend yourself?

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:42.630
I'd get Lasik.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.920
Because you break your glasses, or you lose a contact... like -

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.060
you're screwed.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.370
I would say I would hide.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.180
Just hide.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.490
I'm pretty good at hiding.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:50.470
I'm really good at hiding.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.680
I would take cow manure.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.880
and cake it onto myself.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.050
and then I would hide.

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:57.300
They're all hiding?

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.310
F@#$ that S@#$

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:00.760
I'm gonna light flares, and start a bonfire.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.560
And get everybody into one arena.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:04.030
I'm gonna forge an alliance with you.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.480
And then I'll just heave a harpoon into your back.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:07.780
And eat your body.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.930
But you know you told me that, so that's not gonna work.

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:13.990
You son of a b@#$&amp;

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.110
Do you have a tactic for surviving?

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:20.200
Stick with Jennifer Lawrence she always seems to win that.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.480
I'm wondering how Grumpy Cat would survive on The Hunger Games...

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.830
I'm trying to gauge her mood right now.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:32.250
I think she hates us all equally.

